OL,5,G2000 Inside the Operating Theatre
OL,6,     FConnie needs a polyp taking from
OL,7,     Fher womb, Carl is undergoing
OL,8,     Fkeyhole surgery to remove torn
OL,9,     Fcartilage from his knee and Brad
OL,10,     Fis having a varicose vein stripped
OL,11,     Ffrom his leg.
OL,12,G2100 Louis Theroux's Weird Christmas
OL,13,     FThe intrepid reporter meets some
OL,14,     Fstrange and colourful characters
OL,15,     Fon his way to Christmas dinner in
OL,16,     FAmerica, including porn star JJ
OL,17,     FMichael and aspiring folk singer
OL,18,     FMike Oehler.
